{"unit_id":"WoodSettler__dsh-local-proxy#card-zh","repo":"WoodSettler/dsh-local-proxy","commit":"24a7cc02ba6bc6425edc305ea1c9f82d6238e6ab","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-proxy 是一个面向 DSH 桌面和命令行客户端的网络代理插件：它读取显式代理环境配置、Windows 系统代理或继承的代理变量，并把选中的本机 HTTP/HTTPS 代理接入 DSH 的请求分发器及子进程环境。插件支持常见的代理变量和 Windows 注册表中的按协议代理写法，只接受 localhost、127.0.0.1 和 ::1 地址。代理缺失或初始化步骤出错时会记录日志并保持直连；适合需要让 DSH 请求和其启动的命令共用本机代理的用户。运行需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本；无需额外密钥或账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-60","lib/index.js:81-107","lib/index.js:109-237","package.json:39-40"]}
{"unit_id":"WoodSettler__dsh-local-proxy#card-en","repo":"WoodSettler/dsh-local-proxy","commit":"24a7cc02ba6bc6425edc305ea1c9f82d6238e6ab","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-local-proxy routes DSH requests and child processes through a local HTTP proxy. It reads configured variables or the Windows system proxy, accepts loopback addresses, and keeps direct access when setup fails. Requires Node.js 20+; no account or key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-60","lib/index.js:81-107","lib/index.js:109-237","package.json:39-40"]}
