{"unit_id":"WoodSettler__dsh-local-proxy#feature-1","repo":"WoodSettler/dsh-local-proxy","commit":"24a7cc02ba6bc6425edc305ea1c9f82d6238e6ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-proxy 的功能「发现本机代理」：优先采用项目或用户环境中显式配置的代理，其次读取 Windows 系统代理，最后才使用继承的代理环境变量。代理 URL 只接受 HTTP/HTTPS 协议和本机回环地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-60","lib/index.js:123-185"]}
{"unit_id":"WoodSettler__dsh-local-proxy#feature-2","repo":"WoodSettler/dsh-local-proxy","commit":"24a7cc02ba6bc6425edc305ea1c9f82d6238e6ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-proxy 的功能「代理转发」：安装 DSH 进程内分发器，并把 HTTP_PROXY、HTTPS_PROXY、ALL_PROXY 和 NO_PROXY 配置到启动环境，供请求及子进程使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:188-221"]}
{"unit_id":"WoodSettler__dsh-local-proxy#feature-3","repo":"WoodSettler/dsh-local-proxy","commit":"24a7cc02ba6bc6425edc305ea1c9f82d6238e6ab","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-proxy 的功能「代理初始化失败时回退」：插件会捕获激活过程中的错误并写入 DSH logger 及本地日志文件；未发现代理时不修改网络配置，继续使用直连。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-39","lib/index.js:183-185","lib/index.js:232-237"]}
{"unit_id":"WoodSettler__dsh-local-proxy#caveat-1","repo":"WoodSettler/dsh-local-proxy","commit":"24a7cc02ba6bc6425edc305ea1c9f82d6238e6ab","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-local-proxy 只接受 HTTP/HTTPS 类型的本机回环代理；远程代理地址不会被采用，Windows 注册表回退也仅在 Windows 上可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:46-60","lib/index.js:81-85"]}
